title: "SPHERE CLI"
type: software
abstract: >-
  Command-line interface for SPHERE: generate, evaluate and certify
  privacy-preserving synthetic twins of tabular data in research data
  pipelines and on HPC clusters (macOS arm64/x86_64, Linux x86_64).
